          <rdf:li>Autistic Entrapta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta Being Entrapta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mermista being a jerk</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mean Mermista</rdf:li>
